    <!-- Sim only (rover_sim), for DLIO at the sim's lidar density (src/rover_sim/config/worlds.yaml):
         the bare office has long featureless walls and no ceiling, and with ~1400 rays a scan an RR's
         DLIO slid 7-100 m along the 1.4 m west corridor, a JR's up to 13 m along the hall, and z wandered
         9-16 cm on the floor alone. Each box adds ray-cast time to every scan (48 pilasters on all the
         long walls lost real time with the shared cores busy), so these are few. -->
    <!-- Pilasters (0.3 m wide, 0.1 m proud of each face) on the corridor walls, 2.5-4 m apart: structure
         along the corridor axis. One link each, as the walls: ODE culls rays per link. -->
